# one-racket.env: sourced by one-racket.sh before K01 (2026-11-14 preview, out/out/previews/onerk/): in face mode the
# Naked Pace handle card lit only the neck, so one_racket() dropped it and the handle read plain black; it now reaches the
# whole racket (KQ_ONE_RACKET_UNION) and sits 35 deg round the handle axis (KQ_PH_ROLL), where the flat face does not
# mirror it (at 0 deg the face went grey): the face keeps its own tiles and the handle its weave. Only K01's Naked Pace
# scene has a PaceHandle card; the other K01 variants are unchanged by these.
export KQ_ONE_RACKET_UNION=PaceHandle_
export KQ_PH_ROLL=35
